&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A preference for straightforward, concise explanations over legalese and overwrought drafting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort operating outside your areas of expertise and in uncharted legal territory&lt;/p&gt;
