&lt;li&gt;Remote within NSW, VIC, or ACT (Sydney, Melbourne, or Canberra preferred), with regular travel to data center sites, and authorization to work in Australia.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
