&lt;li&gt;8+ years across physical security operations and security systems engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct data center experience, including construction-phase or greenfield security commissioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up or operating a SOC/GSOC or comparable 24/7 monitoring operation&lt;/li&gt;
