&lt;p&gt;Own and execute data strategy for research teams advancing frontier AI capabilities across RLHF, safety, tool use, and agentic workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive strategic vendor partnerships and build scalable frameworks for technical data collection at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and implement operational systems that translate research requirements into high-quality data pipelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build evaluation frameworks and quality standards that ensure data meets the bar for training state-of-the-art AI systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead cross-functional initiatives to optimize research velocity while maintaining rigorous quality standards&lt;/p&gt;
