&lt;p&gt;Anthropic&#39;s Investor Relations team is responsible for managing the company’s engagement with its investors and the broader financial community. The Director of Investor Relations will be responsible for building the company’s investor engagement and investment narrative alongside the Head of Investor Relations, informing investors&#39; understanding of Anthropic’s mission, strategy, financial performance, and core advantages that together form the investment thesis.&lt;/p&gt;
