&lt;li&gt;Have strong troubleshooting skills and are methodical, curious, and persistent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated supporting macOS endpoints and comfortable supporting ChromeOS, iOS, and Android&lt;/li&gt;
