&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a track record of effective, information-rich advocacy with biotech regulators, sector agencies, and Congressional committees of jurisdiction&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Possess scientific fluency in the biological sciences sufficient to engage credibly with technical researchers and translate AI and bio capabilities for policy audiences, whether through formal training or sustained professional work on biotechnologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience designing and advocating for concrete bio policy and regulatory proposals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are adept at working with diverse cross-functional teams, including but not limited to technical research, go-to-market, trust and safety, legal, product, communications, and marketing&lt;/p&gt;
