&lt;li&gt;Own Launch Readiness for Claude.ai: launch checklists, coordination with XFN Teams, and observability into status and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run team operations for Claude.ai &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in feedback-loop systems: intake, triage, synthesis for consumer users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate across functions without formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
