&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years of experience in product operations, program management, or launch readiness roles at fast-paced tech companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have operationalized model performance before, ideally at an application-layer AI product company, without necessarily writing evals yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built or fixed an operational process end-to-end, not just executed someone else&#39;s plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in ambiguity, this role is still being defined&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring real cross-functional influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built a feedback or issue-triage system from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large-scale consumer product experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup 0-to-1 background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EAP or beta program experience&lt;/li&gt;
