&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with GTM processes at a software or technology company — lead-to-cash, quote-to-cash, renewal and expansion motions, or customer health&lt;/p&gt;
