&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong program management fundamentals: planning, tracking, dependency and risk management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, with the ability to move between technical detail and executive summary depending on the audience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work effectively in fast-moving environments with high ambiguity, including where process doesn&#39;t exist yet&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excited about Anthropic&#39;s mission to develop AI that is safe and beneficial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with lead and campaign automation, CPQ implementations, or customer success and health-scoring programs (Gainsight or equivalent) at a software company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
