&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;1:1-1:19;0-18&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:314;20-333&quot;&gt;We are looking for a State and Local Affairs Lead to lead Anthropic&#39;s engagement with state and local governments across the Southern United States, advancing AI policy, legislation, and regulation that supports Anthropic&#39;s mission of ensuring that the world safely makes the transition through transformative AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:454;335-788&quot;&gt;In this role, you will work closely with Anthropic&#39;s Southern Regional State and Local Lead, as well as coordinate with our Policy leadership, Communications, and Legal teams. You will own Anthropic&#39;s relationships and legislative and regulatory work across the South—engagement with state legislatures, governors&#39; offices, attorneys general, state agencies, and local governments. You will be based in Texas and will travel regularly across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:362;790-1151&quot;&gt;Successful candidates will demonstrate a track record of political strategy and execution—with specific examples of how you have contributed to complex policy campaigns, built durable relationships with elected officials and community leaders, supported legislative and regulatory outcomes, and executed with accountability and focus in fast-paced environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:524;1153-1676&quot;&gt;Anthropic is equal parts research lab, policy think-tank, and technology startup. We care deeply about safe development of AI systems, and build partnership with governments through proactive, opinionated, substantive policy conversations. We recognize that our approach to AI policy is genuinely distinctive in the marketplace—grounded in honest assessment of technological trajectories and authentic concern for safe scaling—and we need a regional lead who can bring that positioning to life at the state and local level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:320;1678-1997&quot;&gt;This role offers an opportunity to be part of building a high-impact state affairs operation at a critical moment for AI policy. You will be responsible for executing on strategic priorities across your region, building relationships with government stakeholders, and contributing to the broader state affairs function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:25;1999-2023&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-24:151;2025-3537&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:186;2025-2210&quot;&gt;Serve as Anthropic&#39;s lead for state and local government affairs across the Southern United States, working in close coordination with the other Regional State and Local Affairs Leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:161;2211-2371&quot;&gt;Build and maintain relationships with state legislators, legislative staff, governors&#39; offices, attorneys general, and state agency leaders across your region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:154;2372-2525&quot;&gt;Engage directly with local officials whose decisions affect Anthropic&#39;s work—mayors, city councils, county commissions, and economic development boards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:201;2526-2726&quot;&gt;Track state and local legislation and regulatory proceedings affecting AI and the technology sector, provide analysis and intelligence to inform company strategy, and represent Anthropic&#39;s positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:185;2727-2911&quot;&gt;Build durable partnerships with local and regional organizations, including chambers of commerce, economic development groups, labor organizations, universities, and school districts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:132;2912-3043&quot;&gt;Represent Anthropic at legislative hearings, regional events, and public forums, including with audiences who are skeptical of AI&lt;/li&gt;
