&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:80;3567-3646&quot;&gt;Align with our mission and embrace the imperative of policy impact and change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:177;3647-3823&quot;&gt;Have experience in state and local government affairs, political strategy, or legislative roles, with demonstrated success contributing to legislative and regulatory outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:105;3824-3928&quot;&gt;Are based in Texas, or are willing to relocate, and are prepared to travel regularly across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:191;3929-4119&quot;&gt;Have existing relationships with state and local leaders in Texas and other Southern states, including legislators, governors&#39; offices, attorneys general, or county and municipal officials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:208;4120-4327&quot;&gt;Understand how state legislatures and executive branches work—committee processes, legislative and regulatory procedures, and how to move policy forward—and understand where local authority begins and ends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:122;4328-4449&quot;&gt;Have a track record of executing on strategic objectives and delivering measurable outcomes in government affairs roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:167;4450-4616&quot;&gt;Have experience building partnerships with external organizations including chambers of commerce, economic development groups, labor organizations, and universities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;35:1-35:120;4617-4736&quot;&gt;Demonstrate understanding of how to build coalitions and identify aligned constituencies to advance shared objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;36:1-36:133;4737-4869&quot;&gt;Can manage multiple priorities and stakeholder relationships across different states and adapt to different political environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;37:1-37:104;4870-4973&quot;&gt;Have the ability to work under time pressure and manage competing demands in high-stakes environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;38:1-38:110;4974-5083&quot;&gt;Can translate complex technical topics into clear, accessible language for policymakers and residents alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:104;5084-5187&quot;&gt;Have experience working with communications teams to develop effective messaging for policy campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-40:97;5188-5284&quot;&gt;Are comfortable being honest about tradeoffs, including in rooms where people disagree with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
