&lt;li&gt;Design and architect automated enforcement systems and review workflows that scale effectively while maintaining high accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain evals that measure model performance on these policy areas, surface regressions, and inform policy and model improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering and Data Science to optimize detection and automated enforcement systems for potential policy violations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review flagged content to drive enforcement decisions and surface policy gaps, with particular attention to novel or technically sophisticated misuse attempts + emerging extremist movements, ideologies, and mobilization tactics&lt;/li&gt;
