&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of our work is mentioned in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/institute/recursive-self-improvement&quot;&gt;When AI Builds itself&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://claude.com/blog/building-effective-human-agent-teams&quot;&gt;Building effective human-agent teams&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
