&lt;p&gt;About the Role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a builder-minded Startup Partnerships lead to drive the adoption of Claude within the vibrant French and Southern European startup ecosystem. This is a 0-to-1 opportunity -&amp;nbsp; you&#39;ll be designing and executing innovative programs that enable startups to access and build with Claude across France, and expanding reach into Southern European markets (Spain, Italy, and beyond).&lt;/p&gt;
