&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You think about responsible use.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve built with LLMs hands-on and you have an instinct for how they should be used responsibly and effectively inside organizations of all shapes and sizes.&lt;/li&gt;
